# 0228 = 0227 A-route: SET_LINE_CODING OUT moves to the RX service path.
#   0227 did wait/RX-ACK in capture stage, still WinError 31 on reopen.
#   A-route: capture arms ruby_acm_out_pending; ruby_ep0_service EP0_RXPKTRDY
#   consumes it (the verified probe_wr/cmd branch), count==7 persists.
